  "headline": "Listyo Sigit Prabowo Reschedules Ethics Hearing Amid Wiretap Claims",
  "seoTitle": "Listyo Sigit Prabowo Ethics Hearing and Wiretap Claims",
  "metaDescription": "The ethics hearing for Listyo Sigit Prabowo regarding wiretapping allegations has been postponed after the officer declined to attend the scheduled session.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Police Code of Ethics Commission postponed the disciplinary hearing for Listyo Sigit Prabowo until next Monday.",
    "The delay followed the officer's refusal to attend the session, which prompted criticism from legislative members regarding institutional accountability.",
    "Police officials clarified that separate proceedings against Kombes Iman Imanuddin are unrelated to the ongoing wiretapping investigation."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The National Police of Indonesia, through the Professional and Security Division, has initiated ethics proceedings concerning allegations of unauthorized wiretapping. Public and media scrutiny intensified after Listyo Sigit Prabowo declined to appear at a scheduled ethics hearing, leading to its postponement until the following week. Members of the House of Representatives have publicly expressed concerns, suggesting that such absences could adversely impact the reputation of the police force and the authority of the National Police Chief. While the investigation remains a primary focus, police authorities confirmed that concurrent ethics hearings for other officers, such as Kombes Iman Imanuddin for his actions as Director of General Crimes at the Jakarta Metro Police, are separate matters. Observers have noted that non-attendance at disciplinary panels is not an unprecedented event within the organization, according to oversight representatives.",
